<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Privacy notice' }) %>
<article class="card prose">
  <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
  <p class="callout warn small">Template — the firm must replace the bracketed items and have this reviewed by its Information Officer.</p>
  <h2>Who processes your information</h2>
  <p><%= firmName %>, registration [number], Information Officer: [name, email]. Registered with the Information Regulator.</p>
  <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
  <p>To comply with the Financial Intelligence Centre Act 38 of 2001 (customer due diligence, sanctions screening, record keeping) and our Risk Management and Compliance Programme. Processing is necessary to comply with a legal obligation (POPIA s11(1)(c)).</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>Name, identity/passport number, date of birth, nationality, contact details, residential address, occupation, source of funds, PEP status, and copies of your identity document and proof of address.</p>
  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>Our verification and screening provider [name] (an operator bound by a POPIA s21 agreement), and the Financial Intelligence Centre where the law requires.</p>
  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>At least five years after our business relationship ends, as FICA requires, after which it is securely destroyed.</p>
  <h2>How we protect it</h2>
  <p>Encrypted in transit (TLS) and at rest (AES-256), access limited to authorised staff using multi-factor authentication, and every access is logged.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You may request access to or correction of your information, or lodge a complaint with the Information Regulator (inforegulator.org.za).</p>
</article>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
